        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9655151367188,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "rapid and early testing for the detection of fluoroquinolone resistance is essential before",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9312133789062,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "starting treatment with the all-oral MDR/RR-TB shorter regimen (i.e. 6–9 months); this may",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        524.48828125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "also become relevant (depending on the epidemiological context) if new shorter drug-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.66120147705078,
        429.35614013671875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "susceptible TB regimens that include fluoroquinolones are introduced;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        144.3061981201172
