      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        131.16119384765625,
        527.1185302734375,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "these tests can be used to rule in ethionamide resistance, but not to rule out resistance,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.927490234375,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "because mutations conferring resistance to ethionamide are not limited to the  A promoter  inh",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        349.1673583984375,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "region – they also include  A,  R and other genes; eth eth",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
