      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        177.66119384765625,
        526.9863891601562,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "culture-based phenotypic DST may still be required, particularly among those with a high",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.16119384765625,
        527.0247802734375,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "pretest probability of resistance when the low complexity automated NAATs does not detect",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.952346801757812,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.66119384765625,
        373.795654296875,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "drug resistance; in addition, culture-based phenotypic DST:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
